# These are some examples of commonly ignored file patterns.
# You should customize this list as applicable to your project.
# Learn more about .gitignore:
#     https://www.atlassian.com/git/tutorials/saving-changes/gitignore

# Node artifact files
node_modules/
dist/

# Compiled Java class files
*.class

# Compiled Python bytecode
*.py[cod]

# Log files
*.log

# Package files
*.jar

# Maven
target/
dist/

# JetBrains IDE
.idea/

# Unit test reports
TEST*.xml

# Generated by MacOS
.DS_Store

# Generated by Windows
Thumbs.db

# Applications
*.app
*.exe
*.war

# Large media files
*.mp4
*.tiff
*.avi
*.flv
*.mov
*.wmv

# VS Code
.vscode
# Training and harness runtime artifacts (local-only, potentially very large)
/logs/
/runs/
/wandb/
/*.launch.json

# other
*.egg-info
__pycache__

# Local paper corpus (large generated/research data)
/docs/papers/

# Presentation: only the final delivery and its supporting notes are tracked.
/docs/present_first/*
!/docs/present_first/README.md
!/docs/present_first/presentation_notes.md
!/docs/present_first/presentation_equations.md
!/docs/present_first/assets/
/docs/present_first/assets/*
!/docs/present_first/assets/v10_evidence.json
!/docs/present_first/assets/v12_math_preview.json
!/docs/present_first/융캡2 초안 발표 최종본/
!/docs/present_first/융캡2 초안 발표 최종본/TF43000.mp4
!/docs/present_first/융캡2 초안 발표 최종본/JT43000.mp4
!/docs/present_first/융캡2 초안 발표 최종본/JT43500.mp4
!/docs/present_first/융캡2 초안 발표 최종본/JT71500.mp4

# Manuscript: explicit user authorization covers current TeX and selected assets.
# Raw research downloads, training state and other private working files stay local.
/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/*
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/latex/
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/latex/.vscode/
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/latex/.vscode/settings.json
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/
/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/*
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/a1_robot_20261011_212425_original.png
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/isaac_gym_original.png
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/paper_workflow_v8.pdf
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/paper_workflow_clean.pdf
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/paper_learning_v10.pdf
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/paper_metrics_v10.pdf
!/docs/submission/ieie2026/private/assets/paper_joint_tracking20_v12.pdf
/docs/submission/ieie2026/rendered/
/docs/submission/ieie2026/results/
/docs/submission/ieie2026/reviewer/

# Local scratch launch notes and accidental CLI marker files
/How to Launch.md
/--
/--authority
/--experiment
/--label
/--parent-run-id
/--phase
/--trend-min-iteration
